And then when you look up
at the particular bike,

00:31:39.930 --> 00:31:42.530
you don't expect to see
a Pee-wee Herman bike,

00:31:42.530 --> 00:31:43.693
but here we are.

00:31:43.693 --> 00:31:44.876
I mean, you can be serious about it.

00:31:44.876 --> 00:31:45.709
But you know what I'm saying.

00:31:45.709 --> 00:31:47.851
Like a really nice beach cruiser.

00:31:47.851 --> 00:31:49.670
Top of the line beach
cruiser. Yeah, I get it.

00:31:49.670 --> 00:31:53.200
But like painted in like
it was like an aqua,

00:31:53.200 --> 00:31:54.210
there's like flowers or something.

00:31:54.210 --> 00:31:57.890
I don't know, it's another,
