00:33:05.730 --> 00:33:08.400
but I take my own
responsibility for my own life.

00:33:08.400 --> 00:33:11.340
And when in Key West, I don't
wear a helmet when I bike.

00:33:11.340 --> 00:33:14.620
And also you get dressed
up to go to dinner.

00:33:14.620 --> 00:33:17.310
And for Jessie, that
