00:33:30.740 --> 00:33:32.630
to go in a stirrup that same way.

00:33:32.630 --> 00:33:34.530
Yeah, and she's got it figured out,

00:33:34.530 --> 00:33:36.990
but Jessie had not figured this out.

00:33:36.990 --> 00:33:38.690
And also the thing about Jessie is

00:33:39.930 --> 00:33:43.053
both Jessie and I tend
to be rule followers.

00:33:44.070 --> 00:33:47.220
Jessie tends to be maybe a little bit more

00:33:47.220 --> 00:33:48.350
of a rule follower than me.

00:33:48.350 --> 00:33:49.490
When I'm on a bike, I'm like,

00:33:49.490 --> 00:33:52.790
yeah, I know that the traffic
laws technically apply to me,

00:33:52.790 --> 00:33:55.760
but I'm on an island and
it's Key West and who cares?

00:33:55.760 --> 00:33:56.900
And so there's a stop.

00:33:56.900 --> 00:33:59.240
I'm not gonna stop at the
stop sign if I don't need to.

00:33:59.240 --> 00:34:01.600
And hey, this is a red
