"I'm not comfortable on the bike."

00:34:21.228 --> 00:34:22.350
Course, you weren't there for the fight

00:34:22.350 --> 00:34:23.310
'cause she was still
back at the red light.

00:34:23.310 --> 00:34:24.377
Yeah, and she's like,

