She had a point.

00:34:38.670 --> 00:34:40.160
She's gonna have to take the dress off,

00:34:40.160 --> 00:34:42.043
put on some glitter to get back home.

00:34:43.790 --> 00:34:44.623
She'll get there, don't worry about it.

00:34:44.623 --> 00:34:47.210
We ended up modifying
the bike plan for Jessie.

00:34:47.210 --> 00:34:48.277
Oh, I thought you were gonna say,

00:34:48.277 --> 00:34:49.770
"We ended up modifying the bike."

00:34:49.770 --> 00:34:50.957
Yeah, we created a flotilla of bikes.

00:34:50.957 --> 00:34:52.920
It's more like a car.

00:34:52.920 --> 00:34:54.970
We put her in a wagon, like one of those-

00:34:54.970 --> 00:34:56.990
We did talk about renting the golf cart

00:34:56.990 --> 00:34:59.960
because the golf carts, I
mean, the golf cart's so great.

00:34:59.960 --> 00:35:02.274
I haven't seen your dad's down
in Myrtle Beach, but like-

00:35:02.274 --> 00:35:03.860
Oh, I showed you the picture. life.

00:35:03.860 --> 00:35:07.270
But like can his fit six people?

00:35:07.270 --> 00:35:08.290
No.
Like two rows

00:35:08.290 --> 00:35:09.700
and then one facing the back?

00:35:09.700 --> 00:35:12.800
No, his doesn't have that second row.

00:35:12.800 --> 00:35:13.990
It just has a back facing.

00:35:13.990 --> 00:35:15.470
Most of the ones in Key West

00:35:15.470 --> 00:35:19.790
have capacity for six or
as many as can hold on.

00:35:19.790 --> 00:35:23.470
Plus very loud speakers,
which is another thing.

00:35:23.470 --> 00:35:24.520
Yeah, he's got that.

00:35:24.520 --> 00:35:26.730
You gotta, and Chris and Ashley were on,

00:35:26.730 --> 00:35:27.980
they were ready for this.

00:35:28.890 --> 00:35:30.190
They have a speaker

00:35:30.190 --> 00:35:32.540
that Ashley puts in the front of her bike

00:35:32.540 --> 00:35:35.370
and they have a playlist that's got,

00:35:35.370 --> 00:35:37.810
I mean, it goes everywhere,

00:35:37.810 --> 00:35:39.470
but it goes everywhere with us

00:35:39.470 --> 00:35:42.113
and we bring the music
to wherever they go.

00:35:42.113 --> 00:35:44.153
♪ Wasting away again ♪

00:35:44.153 --> 00:35:45.050
Like that?
No.

